      'Use one controlled baseline with a local deviation register. The baseline covers the normal load, approved rack pattern, acceptance result, operator decisions, training, records, and escalation. The site register covers what differs and who approved the response. Headquarters owns the baseline; a named local owner closes the site gates; the supplier supports configuration-specific evidence.',
